# Keep the Docker build context narrow: the vLLM image needs the pinned
# VibeVoice checkout plus the isolated FastAPI runtime files, but not local
# secrets, certs, tests, clients, proxy build output, or virtualenv state.
*

# Whitelist files copied by Dockerfile
!VibeVoice/
!VibeVoice/**
!server/
!server/**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock

# Exclude VibeVoice subdirectories not needed for pip install
VibeVoice/.git/
VibeVoice/demo/
VibeVoice/docs/
VibeVoice/Figures/
VibeVoice/finetuning-asr/
